Features:
- support log children/proxies, similar to bunyan, for sectioning (should also set a top-level log name. Should that be hierarchical?)
- consider depth-based log filtering (I want log messages from root loggers, but not children)
- add hostname, pid, tid (all optional)
- add textual log levels as well as numeric
- logger name?


Separate logsink lib?
- Expected log messages (if this occurs it is not an error. If it does not occur, that is an error (useful for testing)
- buffering: copy messages to memory buffer. If a message of severity X occurs, flush buffer
